      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "AI 框架中常指多维数值数组\n文本批次：[batch, token, dim]\n图像批次：[batch, channel, H, W]\n张量的阶数 = 轴数\n不等于矩阵的秩 rank(A)",
      "originalText": "AI 框架中常指多维数值数组\n文本批次：[batch, token, dim]\n图像批次：[batch, channel, H, W]\n张量的阶数 = 轴数\n不等于矩阵的秩 rank(A)",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
