      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "f:R^d→R^h 的 J 形状为 h×d\nJ_ij=∂f_i/∂x_j\n局部变化：Δf≈JΔx\n链式法则：复合函数导数相乘\n反传常计算向量—Jacobian 积\n无需显式存出完整 Jacobian",
      "originalText": "f:R^d→R^h 的 J 形状为 h×d\nJ_ij=∂f_i/∂x_j\n局部变化：Δf≈JΔx\n链式法则：复合函数导数相乘\n反传常计算向量—Jacobian 积\n无需显式存出完整 Jacobian",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
