      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "Z=XW+b；令 G=∂L/∂Z\n∂L/∂W=XᵀG：d×h\n∂L/∂X=GWᵀ：N×d\n∂L/∂b：沿样本轴对 G 求和\n若 L 有平均因子，已体现在 G 中\n梯度形状必须与对应参数一致",
      "originalText": "Z=XW+b；令 G=∂L/∂Z\n∂L/∂W=XᵀG：d×h\n∂L/∂X=GWᵀ：N×d\n∂L/∂b：沿样本轴对 G 求和\n若 L 有平均因子，已体现在 G 中\n梯度形状必须与对应参数一致",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
