      "fontSize": 23,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "X=[1,2,3]ᵀ，y=[1,2,2]ᵀ\n无截距：w=(Xᵀy)/(XᵀX)=11/14\n预测 Xw=[11,22,33]ᵀ/14\n残差 r=[3,6,−5]ᵀ/14\nXᵀr=(3+12−15)/14=0\n结论：最优残差与列空间正交",
      "originalText": "X=[1,2,3]ᵀ，y=[1,2,2]ᵀ\n无截距：w=(Xᵀy)/(XᵀX)=11/14\n预测 Xw=[11,22,33]ᵀ/14\n残差 r=[3,6,−5]ᵀ/14\nXᵀr=(3+12−15)/14=0\n结论：最优残差与列空间正交",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
